flowchart TD
    A[New FOG sample] --> B[Conformal prediction set]
    B --> C{Calibration and shift requirements satisfied?}
    C -->|No| D[Conservative withhold or human review]
    C -->|Yes| E{Prediction set is single label?}
    E -->|No or empty| D
    E -->|Yes| F[Advisory evidence routed through FOG safeguards]
    F --> G[Offline local queue if disconnected]
    G --> H{Staleness within retention limit?}
    H -->|No| I[Delete content-bearing local record and preserve minimal expiry audit]
    H -->|Yes| J[Append-only synchronization]
    J --> K{Conflict detected?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Preserve branches and require human review]
    K -->|No| M[Store synchronized advisory history]
    M --> N[Evaluate aggregation-window Pareto front]
    N --> O[Human selects weights and window]
    O --> P[Optional derived sensor imputation]
    P --> Q{Validation and drift bounds met?}
    Q -->|No| D
    Q -->|Yes| R[Reduce uncertainty only; never relabel as direct evidence]
